  "title": "Korean-Style Braised (Slow Cooker) Baby Back Ribs",
  "description": "This recipe for Korean-style braised (slow cooker) baby back ribs is a slow cooker sensation with ginger, garlic, scallions, rice wine, and orange juice.",
  "authors": [
    "William Leon"
  ],
